==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|es|la|somniāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|somniō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|es|/soˈɲaɾ/}}

===Verb===
{{es-verb|soñ|ar|pres=sueño}}

# {{indtr|es|con|en|intr=1}} to [[dream]] (of/about)
#: {{ux|es|'''Soñé''' contigo anoche.|I '''dreamt''' about you last night.}}
#: {{ux|es|'''Sueño''' con trabajar en esta empresa.|I '''dream''' of working in this company.}}

====Usage notes====
* In general terms, ''dream '''about''''' is ''soñar '''en''''' while ''dream '''of''''' is ''soñar '''con'''''.

====Conjugation====
{{es-conj-ar|s|ñ|p=o-ue|combined=1}}

===Derived terms===
* {{l|es|sueña con los angelitos}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|es|sueño}} {{g|m}}
* {{l|es|soñador}}

